# armour/woman/mail_sleeve_l: Mail's sleeve over the arm: the upper arm in the mail brick to the elbow
# The slice (P2b wave 1, FOLK-BODY; armour and helms to P2c's ARMOUR / HELMS). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
# WOMAN-WEAR (P2B rollout, 2026-10-22): every side arm key the clips name (runB runF pB pM pF pK pN, guard; the far arm's
# pump keys): the arm's upper arm and forearm in the mail brick (W1: no more bare tunic sleeves in the run or drawn frames).
use person
body woman
role armour mail
layer armNear
anchor shoulderL
keys armL
side L
z 1

view D key down origin 1 -4
|xxv
|xwv

view D key down1 origin 1 -4
|xxv
|xwv

view D key idle origin 1 -4
|xxv
|xwv

view D key up origin 1 -4
|xxv
|yxv

view D key up1 origin 1 -4
|xxv
|yxv

view D key lap origin 1 -4
|xxv
|xwv

view U key down origin 1 -4
|vyx
|vxx

view U key idle origin 1 -4
|vyx
|vxx

view U key up origin 1 -4
|vyx
|vxy

view U key lap origin 1 -4
|vyx
|vxx

view L key B origin 1 -4
|vyxv.
|.vywv

view L key F origin 4 -4
|.vyxv
|vywv.

view L key N origin 2 -4
|vxyv
|vywv

view L key idle origin 2 -4
|vxyv
|vywv

view L key lie origin 0 -3
|vvv
|vxw
|vyx
|.vv

view L key runB origin 1 -4
|vyxv.
|.vywv

view L key runF origin 5 -4
|vy.xyxv

view L key pB origin 2 -1
|vyxv......
|..vywv....
|....vyxv..
|.....vywv.
|.....vyxv.
|......vywv

view L key pM origin 3 -4
|.vyxv
|vywv.
|.vv..

view L key pF origin 4 -1
|..vyxv
|.vywv.
|vyxv..
|vywv..

view L key pK origin 1 -4
|vyxv.
|.vywv

view L key pN origin 3 -4
|.vyxv
|vywv.

view R key pB origin 4 -4
|....vxwv
|..vwwv..
|vxwv....

view R key pM origin 0 -4
|vxwv.
|.vwwv

view R key pF origin 1 -4
|..vxv...
|vwww.wwv

view R key pK origin 2 -4
|.vxwv
|vwwv.

view R key pN origin 0 0
|.

# ---- (P2c SLICE-ARMOUR, ADD) the fall's `fling`; `runF` facing down and up shows only the fist (empty)

view D key fling origin 1 -1
|xwv....
|wxwv...
|.xwxv..

view U key fling origin 5 -1
|....vxx
|...vxyw
|..vxxw.

view L key fling origin 3 -1
|vywxv........
|..vxxwv......
|....vywxv....

view D key runF origin 0 0
|.

view U key runF origin 0 0
|.

